DESCRIPTION >
    Contrast case for map_inference_regression: same named-tuple-shaped JSON
    object, but the target Map is Map(String, String) (no Nullable). The
    ingest fix that shipped for the reported bug special-cased exactly this
    type, so this fixture is expected to append successfully. If it starts
    failing too, the fix regressed. If map_inference_regression (which uses
    Map(String, Nullable(String))) starts passing, the fix was broadened.

SCHEMA >
    `asset_id` String `json:$.asset_id`,
    `properties` Map(String, String) `json:$.properties`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "asset_id"
